\section{Methods}
\label{sec:methods}

\subsection{Overview}

This section details the methodological framework underlying the hybrid
verification architecture. The system integrates:

\begin{enumerate}[label=\arabic*.]
    \item Hybrid dynamical simulation (COSE),
    \item Automated theorem proving (ATP),
    \item Zero-knowledge SNARK verification,
    \item Codex capsule commitment and lineage propagation,
    \item Lyapunov-based contradiction neutralization.
\end{enumerate}

Each layer contributes a distinct form of certainty—logical,
cryptographic, dynamical, and provenance—yielding a unified method for
absolute proof validation.

