\subsection{Capsule Lineage Construction}

Capsule lineage is defined by the ordering relation:

\begin{equation}
\mathcal{C}_i \prec \mathcal{C}_j
\quad \Longleftrightarrow \quad
\mathcal{R}_{ij} \neq 0,
\end{equation}

where the resonance tensor is:

\begin{equation}
\mathcal{R}_{ij}
= \Gamma_i \otimes \Gamma_j.
\end{equation}

Lineage forms a partially ordered set (poset) with resonance-driven
propagation.

