\subsection{Contradiction Neutralization}

Contradictions correspond to unstable trajectories:

\begin{equation}
\dot{\mathcal{V}}(X) > 0.
\end{equation}

The PVP enforces:

\begin{equation}
\dot{\mathcal{V}}(X) > 0
\quad \Rightarrow \quad
\mathcal{V}_{\mathrm{PVP}}(\Pi, \psi) = 0.
\end{equation}

This ensures contradictions cannot propagate through ATP, SNARK, or
Codex layers.

